{
  "slug": "claude-meister",
  "name": "Claude Meister",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Claude Code is great, but treating every prompt with full context is too expensive. I built Claude_Meister as an MCP plugin to dynamically route tasks and score memory, dropping context token usage by 40%.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `configure-claude-meister` (Configure Claude_Meister behavior using documented settings and runtime controllers in this repository), `install-claude-meister` (Install or update Claude_Meister using commands that are implemented in install.py), `troubleshoot-claude-meister` (Diagnose and resolve Claude_Meister install, verification, and runtime issues using repo troubleshooting guidance), `verify-claude-meister` (Run verification and test checks for Claude_Meister using repo-defined commands)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install claude-meister@claude-community` from `Mintsolester/claude-meister` (`plugins/claude-meister`).",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
    "antigravity",
    "codex"
  ],
